                                "sense_id": "ba91d7bb-bcf9-33a5-8157-ae3722a4e2a3",
                                "text": "The morning o'er the gilded grove\nBright on the kindling landscape fell,\nI sought her where she oft did rove\nIn want and sorrow's lonely cell;—"
